{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Santander — Ensemble with Power Averaging\n",
    "\n",
    "基于四个基础模型的预测概率，使用多种 ensemble 方法对比，找到最优提交。\n",
    "\n",
    "**模型列表：**\n",
    "- ExtraTrees\n",
    "- LightGBM\n",
    "- Logistic Regression\n",
    "- Random Forest\n",
    "\n",
    "**方法对比：**\n",
    "- Simple Average\n",
    "- Rank Average\n",
    "- Power Average (p = 2, 4, 8, 16)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.rcParams['figure.figsize'] = (12, 5)\n",
    "plt.rcParams['font.size'] = 12"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. 加载各模型预测文件"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ---- 如果在 Kaggle 上跑，把路径改成 /kaggle/working/submission_xxx.csv ----\n",
    "et  = pd.read_csv('submission_extratrees.csv')\n",
    "lgb = pd.read_csv('submission_lightgbm.csv')\n",
    "lr  = pd.read_csv('submission_logistic_regression.csv')\n",
    "rf  = pd.read_csv('submission_random_forest.csv')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 确认 ID 对齐\n",
    "assert (et['ID'].values == lgb['ID'].values).all(), 'ID mismatch: ET vs LGB'\n",
    "assert (et['ID'].values == lr['ID'].values).all(),  'ID mismatch: ET vs LR'\n",
    "assert (et['ID'].values == rf['ID'].values).all(),  'ID mismatch: ET vs RF'\n",
    "print('✅ ID 对齐检查通过')\n",
    "\n",
    "# 汇总为矩阵，shape = (n_samples, n_models)\n",
    "probs = np.column_stack([\n",
    "    et['TARGET'].values,\n",
    "    lgb['TARGET'].values,\n",
    "    lr['TARGET'].values,\n",
    "    rf['TARGET'].values,\n",
    "])\n",
    "model_names = ['ExtraTrees', 'LightGBM', 'LogisticReg', 'RandomForest']\n",
    "IDs = et['ID'].values\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'预测矩阵 shape: {probs.shape}')\n",
    "print(f'\\n各模型概率统计:')\n",
    "stats = pd.DataFrame(probs, columns=model_names).describe().loc[['mean','std','min','max']]\n",
    "print(stats.round(4))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 概率分布可视化 — 了解各模型的置信度差异"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 4, figsize=(18, 4))\n",
    "colors = ['#2196F3', '#FF9800', '#4CAF50', '#9C27B0']\n",
    "\n",
    "for ax, name, col, color in zip(axes, model_names, probs.T, colors):\n",
    "    ax.hist(col, bins=50, color=color, alpha=0.8, edgecolor='white')\n",
    "    ax.set_title(f'{name}\\nmean={col.mean():.4f}', fontsize=11)\n",
    "    ax.set_xlabel('Predicted Probability')\n",
    "    ax.set_ylabel('Count')\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle('Predicted Probability Distributions per Model', fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig('dist_models.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Ensemble 函数定义"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def simple_average(probs):\n",
    "    \"\"\"每个模型等权平均\"\"\"\n",
    "    return probs.mean(axis=1)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def rank_average(probs):\n",
    "    \"\"\"把每个模型的概率替换成排名再平均\n",
    "    优点：消除模型间概率尺度差异\n",
    "    缺点：丢失了置信度信息\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    n = probs.shape[0]\n",
    "    ranks = np.zeros_like(probs)\n",
    "    for i in range(probs.shape[1]):\n",
    "        # argsort 两次得到排名，从1到n\n",
    "        ranks[:, i] = probs[:, i].argsort().argsort() + 1\n",
    "    # 归一化到 [0, 1]\n",
    "    return ranks.mean(axis=1) / n\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def power_average(probs, p):\n",
    "    \"\"\"对每个模型概率取 p 次方再平均，最后取 1/p 次方还原尺度\n",
    "    \n",
    "    核心逻辑：\n",
    "    - 高概率 (接近1) 经过 p 次方后仍然高\n",
    "    - 低概率 (接近0) 经过 p 次方后被压得更低\n",
    "    - p 越大，只有多数模型高度同意为正的样本才会保留高概率\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    powered = np.power(probs, p)\n",
    "    avg = powered.mean(axis=1)\n",
    "    return np.power(avg, 1.0 / p)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "print('函数定义完成')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. 生成所有 Ensemble 预测"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "results = {}\n",
    "\n",
    "results['Simple Average']  = simple_average(probs)\n",
    "results['Rank Average']    = rank_average(probs)\n",
    "results['Power p=2']       = power_average(probs, p=2)\n",
    "results['Power p=4']       = power_average(probs, p=4)\n",
    "results['Power p=8']       = power_average(probs, p=8)\n",
    "results['Power p=16']      = power_average(probs, p=16)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 汇总统计\n",
    "print('=== 各 Ensemble 方法预测概率统计 ===')\n",
    "summary = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "    name: pd.Series(pred).describe()\n",
    "    for name, pred in results.items()\n",
    "}).loc[['mean','std','min','max']]\n",
    "print(summary.round(5))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. 可视化对比 — Power 越高概率分布越集中"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 3, figsize=(18, 10))\n",
    "colors_map = {\n",
    "    'Simple Average': '#607D8B',\n",
    "    'Rank Average':   '#795548',\n",
    "    'Power p=2':      '#2196F3',\n",
    "    'Power p=4':      '#4CAF50',\n",
    "    'Power p=8':      '#FF9800',\n",
    "    'Power p=16':     '#F44336',\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "for ax, (name, pred) in zip(axes.flat, results.items()):\n",
    "    color = colors_map.get(name, '#9E9E9E')\n",
    "    ax.hist(pred, bins=60, color=color, alpha=0.85, edgecolor='white')\n",
    "    ax.set_title(f'{name}\\nmean={pred.mean():.5f}, std={pred.std():.5f}', fontsize=11)\n",
    "    ax.set_xlabel('Ensemble Probability')\n",
    "    ax.set_ylabel('Count')\n",
    "    ax.grid(True, alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle('Ensemble Probability Distributions (All Methods)', fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig('dist_ensemble.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n💡 观察：Power p 越大，低概率被压得越低，分布越右偏')\n",
    "print('   说明 Power Average 让模型更"专注"于高置信度的正样本')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. 保存所有 Ensemble 提交文件"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "saved_files = []\n",
    "\n",
    "for name, pred in results.items():\n",
    "    # 文件名处理：空格替换为下划线，去掉等号\n",
    "    fname = 'submission_ensemble_' + name.lower().replace(' ', '_').replace('=', '') + '.csv'\n",
    "    sub = pd.DataFrame({'ID': IDs, 'TARGET': pred})\n",
    "    sub.to_csv(fname, index=False)\n",
    "    saved_files.append(fname)\n",
    "    print(f'✅ 已保存: {fname}')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'\\n共生成 {len(saved_files)} 个提交文件')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. （可选）模型间相关性 — 确认 Ensemble 有意义\n",
    "\n",
    "Ensemble 的核心价值来自**模型多样性**。如果两个模型预测完全一样，加在一起没有提升。\n",
    "相关系数越低 = 模型越多样 = Ensemble 收益越大。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "corr_df = pd.DataFrame(probs, columns=model_names)\n",
    "corr_matrix = corr_df.corr()\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(7, 6))\n",
    "sns.heatmap(\n",
    "    corr_matrix,\n",
    "    annot=True, fmt='.3f',\n",
    "    cmap='RdYlGn_r',\n",
    "    vmin=0.5, vmax=1.0,\n",
    "    square=True,\n",
    "    linewidths=0.5,\n",
    "    annot_kws={'size': 12}\n",
    ")\n",
    "plt.title('Model Prediction Correlation\\n(lower = more diverse = ensemble is more valuable)', fontsize=12)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig('model_correlation.png', dpi=150, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n解读：')\n",
    "print('  相关系数 > 0.95 → 两模型高度相似，ensemble 收益有限')\n",
    "print('  相关系数 < 0.85 → 模型有差异，ensemble 值得做')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. 提交建议\n",
    "\n",
    "按照参考帖子的经验排序，**建议先提交这几个**（从最可能好到保守）：\n",
    "\n",
    "| 优先级 | 文件 | 理由 |\n",
    "|--------|------|---------|\n",
    "| ⭐⭐⭐ | `submission_ensemble_power_p8.csv` | 帖子中实验最优 |\n",
    "| ⭐⭐⭐ | `submission_ensemble_power_p4.csv` | 通常 public/private 最平衡 |\n",
    "| ⭐⭐ | `submission_ensemble_power_p2.csv` | 稳健基准 |\n",
    "| ⭐⭐ | `submission_ensemble_simple_average.csv` | 对比基准 |\n",
    "| ⭐ | `submission_ensemble_rank_average.csv` | 通常最差，参考用 |\n",
    "\n",
    "**注意**：Kaggle 每天提交次数有限，建议先提 p=4 和 p=8，看 public LB 后再决定。"
   ]
  }
